{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>Therefore men fear Him</b> — but He does not see even the wise of heart, as in the verse, \"Behold, the nations are as a drop from the bucket\" [Isaiah 40:15]. And most of the commentators interpret: \"He sees\" — that He turns His attention to all the wise of heart; and the sense is: they fear Him, and if they do not fear Him…"], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:01.842490148Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}